{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the forest... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.webm?t=1772702920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.mp4?t=1772702920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frenetic Pacifist Engagements... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits, wiles, and grappling thread to collect the shattered stars of lost monsters, hungry beasts, and forgotten gods, fallen prey to fear and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.gif?t=1772702920\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/957af0564918153b709199a4ec2dee02.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Twisting Paths... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind your way through forgotten forests, coursing rivers, slimy marshlands, dripping caves, and unstable towers, under the endless eyes of what look like stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.gif?t=1772702920\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/cd5c62d81f0a57cf998194ea0115b19e.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter Strange Folk... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trinkets, discuss riddles, learn secrets, solve dreams, and help the denizens of the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.gif?t=1772702920\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/584377ff2b0878ef06e45ac7f6d4de3d.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn &amp; Hand-Crafted... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure made just for you! We forged this forest out of blood, and ink, and thought. Come, join us for a while, we are only small, and there is space enough to share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.gif?t=1772702920\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/d6c8859390135f235682f5d5d1221d8f.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forest Contains... </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, frenetic engagements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets by the bagful, for you to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hundreds of hand-crafted rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People, with hopes and dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds (if you walk softly, you may hear them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ungodly quantity of keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pages and pages of hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sword! (not to be used as a weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No secrets. <i>we promise there are no secrets in the forest...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.gif?t=1772702920\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/637c28f56341b2412671ad6ca03dc1a6.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2878580?t=1772702920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772702920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/b013296848a88d5cab97427e573db521af1e47cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772702920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/b013296848a88d5cab97427e573db521af1e47cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772702920","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3539800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the forest... </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e25324830ee32ad8f1ee227.poster.avif?t=1772702920\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/extras/afb50dbb4e253