te":"18 Feb, 2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cKey Fairy's forest is a place I want to live, and I'm very grateful for even a short opportunity to spend time in it.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cI will return to Key Fairy, to remind myself that I too am a little fish in a big pond, full of creatures who want to be nice but need a little help. I will return to hear tales and songs, to wander off the path, to get wonderfully hopelessly lost, but ultimately find my way again.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 SIFTER<br><br>\u201cI can\u2019t and won\u2019t spoil the game\u2019s final encounter, but on both a gameplay and presentation level, it was one of my favourite boss fights in recent history. Truly, it\u2019s something special. [...] Easily one of my favourite games I\u2019ve played in a hot minute, unique doesn\u2019t even begin to describe how one-of-a-kind this title truly is.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 WellPlayed<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/bf18676544ae4cd0759b34a04a2dbb336a7034d4/ss_bf18676544ae4cd0759b34a04a2dbb336a7034d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772702920","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/bf18676544ae4cd0759b34a04a2dbb336a7034d4/ss_bf18676544ae4cd0759b34a04a2dbb336a7034d4.600x338.jpg?t=1772702920"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/081b76b71709ff0f0fdbd0a198cf31e9eb3bb808/ss_081b76b71709ff0f0fdbd0a198cf31e9eb3bb808.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772702920","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/081b76b71709ff0f0fdbd0a198cf31e9eb3bb808/ss_081b76b71709ff0f0fdbd0a198cf31e9eb3bb808.600x338.jpg?t=1772702920"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878580/041ad27ef1facd0d5cd59da6437b85e4ce7ba1e6/ss_041ad27ef1facd0d5cd59da6437b85e4ce7ba1e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772702920","path_thumb